---
description:
  Verifies that a single classDef with multiple CSS properties (fill, color,
  font-weight, stroke-width, stroke) can be applied to several nodes at once via
  one `class` statement, across a chain of node ids that include numeric-leading
  identifiers.
config:
  fontFamily: courier
---
graph TD
  1A --> 1B
  1B --> 1C
  1C --> D
  1C --> E

  classDef processHead fill:#888888,color:white,font-weight:bold,stroke-width:3px,stroke:#001f3f
  class 1A,1B,D,E processHead
